      <TableCell>BareMetalHostSpec defines the desired state of BareMetalHost.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>status</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>object</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>BareMetalHostStatus defines the observed state of BareMetalHost.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
